WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:03.435
We're just a few days removed
from what we assume

00:00:03.435 --> 00:00:05.471
was Serena Williams' farewell.

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:06.973
Thoughts on the aftermath?

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:08.841
RENEE MONTGOMERY: You know,
the first thing I noticed

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:11.511
is that the post
that she posted after,

00:00:11.744 --> 00:00:13.612
she posted herself in the bed
and said,

00:00:13.712 --> 00:00:15.381
"I'm enjoying my weekend,
how 'bout you?"

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:17.683
And so I don't think people
understand that about athletes.

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:20.486
The first thing I saw was like,
she probably finally had like

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:22.588
the best rest of her life
in the sense

00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:25.491
of not worrying about--
Before she even retired,

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:26.859
I remember last year
people were asking her,

00:00:26.992 --> 00:00:27.927
"When are you retiring?"

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:29.395
So there was that lead up
to when you start

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:32.631
to get a certain age in sports,
people start to retire you.

00:00:32.698 --> 00:00:34.067
Like, "Oh, hey,
when're you done?

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:35.869
You know, you're 30 now,
what's up?"

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:37.403
And so I just thought, for her,
I was like,

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:39.405
for her to go out
the way she did

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:41.207
you can tell
that her trajectory,

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:42.274
there's more stuff coming.

00:00:42.341 --> 00:00:43.943
But, I don't know,
I just feel like

00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:45.745
that's GOAT status,
we saw it.

